PROVISIONAL LICENSE — NOT A FINAL GRANT, NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE LICENSE
===================================================================

This file is a placeholder. It is deliberately NOT a license that grants
anything. It exists so the package can be built and moved while three
decisions are still open. Do not treat any use of this software as licensed.

STATUS: DRAFT — three blocking decisions unresolved as of 2026-10-17.

1. LICENSOR / COPYRIGHT HOLDER — UNDETERMINED
   The holder of copyright and licensing authority for this software has not
   been identified. A placeholder line naming "contributors" is not a licensor:
   it names no legal entity, no person, and no one capable of granting,
   enforcing, or later amending terms. Until a holder is named, there is no
   party who could grant a license under this file.

2. PACKAGE IDENTITY — UNDETERMINED
   The published distribution name has not been chosen. The working name used
   during development is "capture-proxy", but a unified name covering both the
   carrier and the scoring authority is under consideration. Distribution
   names on PyPI are permanent and cannot be renamed or reused once claimed.

3. COMMERCIAL TERMS — UNDETERMINED
   The intent is a shareware arrangement in which use is free for individuals
   and smaller organisations and a paid grant is required above a stated
   threshold. That threshold, its metric (revenue, headcount, or both), and
   the treatment of use as a dependency in automated builds are all undecided.

WHAT THIS FILE DOES NOT DO
--------------------------
It does not grant permission to use, copy, modify, or distribute this
software. It does not place this software in the public domain. It does not
grant any patent rights. It does not obligate anyone to comply with any
condition.

Until it is replaced by a completed license naming a licensor, the default
position is that no permission has been granted.

REPLACEMENT CONDITIONS
---------------------
Replace this file when all three items above are settled. At that point:

  - state the licensor explicitly
  - state the commercial threshold and its metric
  - state whether distribution, modification, and use as a dependency are
    permitted without charge below that threshold
  - state the term, if any, under which the terms change

VERIFICATION
------------
To confirm this file is still the provisional one:

    head -1 LICENSE

It must print: PROVISIONAL LICENSE -- NOT A FINAL GRANT, NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE LICENSE